%% Status: target. A correction re-runs reasoning only; no image work, no patching the old posterior.
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Android UI
    participant S as shared session
    participant R as shared reasoning

    S-->>UI: Result(top matches, reasons)
    U->>UI: "Glume colour is actually red"
    UI->>S: correctTrait(traitId, state)
    S->>S: replace that TraitEstimate with a<br/>near-certain one (noise floor still applies)
    S->>R: recompute posterior from all stored estimates
    R-->>S: new ranking + explanation
    S-->>UI: updated Result (may run on main thread)
